# hello: the smallest pattern that plays. One track, four steps, a rising line.
# Run it:  just run examples/hello
seed 1
bpm 120
track 0 mch 1
track 0 step 0 active 1
track 0 step 4 active 1
track 0 step 8 active 1
track 0 step 12 active 1
track 0 step 4 pit +4
track 0 step 8 pit +7
track 0 step 12 pit +12
play
render 16 s buffer=64
stop
render 4 s buffer=64
expect event on
expect balance
